    <h1>Delete Your PSC Helper Account</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">App: PSC Helper · Developer: ForUniverse</p>

    <p>We respect your right to control your data. This page explains how to permanently delete your PSC Helper account and the data associated with it.</p>

    <h2>Option 1 — Delete from within the app (Recommended)</h2>

    <div class="step-box">
        <ol>
            <li>Open the <strong>PSC Helper</strong> app on your device</li>
            <li>Sign in if you are not already signed in</li>
            <li>On the home screen, tap the <strong>profile section</strong> (your name and email at the top)</li>
            <li>Scroll down to the <strong>Delete Account</strong> section</li>
            <li>Tap <strong>Delete Account</strong> and confirm your choice</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <p>Your account and all associated data will be permanently deleted immediately.</p>

    <h2>Option 2 — Request deletion by email</h2>

    <p>If you no longer have access to the app, you can request account deletion by emailing us:</p>

    <div class="step-box">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:foruniverse.dev@gmail.com" class="contact-email">foruniverse.dev@gmail.com</a></p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>Subject:</strong> Account Deletion Request — PSC Helper</p>
    </div>

    <p>Please include the following details in your email:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>The email address linked to your PSC Helper account</li>
        <li>The Google account you used to sign in</li>
        <li>A brief reason for deletion (optional)</li>
    </ul>

    <p>We will process your request and delete your account within <strong>7 business days</strong>. You will receive a confirmation email once the deletion is complete.</p>

    <h2>What data is deleted?</h2>

    <p>When you delete your account, the following data is permanently removed from our servers:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Your name and email address</li>
        <li>Your profile picture URL</li>
        <li>Your quiz progress and statistics (questions attempted, correct answers, accuracy)</li>
        <li>Your leaderboard ranking and history</li>
        <li>Any question reports you have submitted</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="warning">
        <strong>⚠️ This action cannot be undone.</strong>
        <p style="margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 0;">Once your account is deleted, your data cannot be recovered. You will need to create a new account if you wish to use PSC Helper again.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>What data is retained?</h2>

    <p>For legal and security reasons, we may retain certain limited information after account deletion:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Anonymous quiz statistics</strong> — used for improving the app, with no link to your identity</li>
        <li><strong>Server logs</strong> — retained for up to 30 days for security and abuse prevention</li>
    </ul>

    <p>No personally identifiable information is retained beyond the deletion process.</p>

    <h2>Need help?</h2>

    <div class="info">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">If you have any questions about deleting your account or our data practices, please contact us at <a href="mailto:foruniverse.dev@gmail.com" class="contact-email">foruniverse.dev@gmail.com</a>. We typically respond within 48 hours.</p>
